;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32646,31655,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32646, 31655, 9)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Elf</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Foreman</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 10, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230824232435&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shirith_801dba.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Shirith.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Two floors underground in front of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Caves\">Shadow Caves</a> mine on Shadow Caves Street\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Shirith, of the Kuridai caste, runs the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Caves\">Shadow Caves</a> troll mine.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203033\"><img alt=\"Silver Key\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Key_57723b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203033\">Key 3033</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">50 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Shirith.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Shirith</strong>: Ashari <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nShirith: I am the overseer of the mines.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mines</b><br/>\nShirith: We hardly get the ore we need. The worthless trolls are lazy workers. I keep them locked up the whole time.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>troll</b><br/>\nShirith: We give these useless creatures a reason to live by serving us.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Teshial</b><br/>\nShirith: Who needs dreamers in these days?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Cenath</b><br/>\nShirith: They think they are better then us.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Deraisim</b><br/>\nShirith: They could do more for us if they would try more hard.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Kuridai</b><br/>\nShirith: We keep this society running. Without our tools and work our case would be a lost one.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nShirith: Asha Thrazi.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Shirith</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32646,"y":31655,"z":9}}